Fuel Mood — third-party data, assets and code

DATA
----
Fuel prices: European Commission, Weekly Oil Bulletin, "Price developments 2005 onwards".
  © European Union, 2005–2026. Licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  Source: https://energy.ec.europa.eu/data-and-analysis/weekly-oil-bulletin_en
  Changes: public/weather.json holds prices converted to €/L plus week-over-week change (Weather),
  change since the Baseline price (Heat) and Weather bands, computed by Fuel Mood (scripts/refresh-data.mjs).

Country borders: Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data @ naturalearthdata.com.
  Natural Earth 1:50m Admin 0 Countries, public domain; clipped and simplified in public/europe.geojson.

